I'm </span><span begin="01:33.660" end="01:35.520">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.830" end="01:52.860"><span begin="01:46.830" end="01:47.370">Show </span><span begin="01:47.370" end="01:47.700">me </span><span begin="01:47.700" end="01:50.160">how </span><span begin="01:50.160" end="01:50.550">you're </span><span begin="01:50.550" end="01:52.860">proud</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.530" end="02:06.960"><span begin="01:58.530" end="01:58.950">Tell </span><span begin="01:58.950" end="01:59.250">me </span><span begin="01:59.250" end="02:01.770">how </span><span begin="02:01.770" end="02:02.220">you </span><span begin="02:02.220" end="02:04.620">reach </span><span begin="02:04.620" end="02:04.920">the </span><span begin="02:04.920" end="02:06.960">moon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.420" end="02:15.600"><span begin="02:09.420" end="02:09.750">My </span><span begin="02:09.750" end="02:10.260">thoughts </span><span begin="02:10.260" end="02:10.650">err </span><span begin="02:10.650" end="02:13.320">away </span><span begin="02:13.320" end="02:15.600">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.970" end="02:27.090"><span begin="02:20.970" end="02:21.390">My </span><span begin="02:21.390" end="02:21.750">heart </span><span begin="02:21.750" end="02:22.050">fell </span><span begin="02:22.050" end="02:22.440">to </span><span begin="02:22.440" end="02:25.080">love </span><span begin="02:25.080" end="02:27.090">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.580" end="02:34.800"><span begin="02:32.580" end="02:32.880">I'm </span><span begin="02:32.880" end="02:33.780">turning </span><span begin="02:33.780" end="02:34.800">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.800" end="02:38.460"><span begin="02:34.800" end="02:35.070">I'm </span><span begin="02:35.070" end="02:35.730">having </span><span begin="02:35.730" end="02:36.570">visions </span><span begin="02:36.570" end="02:36.930">of </span><span begin="02:36.930" end="02:38.460">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.810" end="02:43.020"><span begin="02:39.810" end="02:40.080">But </span><span begin="02:40.080" end="02:41.010">then </span><span begin="02:41.010" end="02:41.730">I </span><span begin="02:41.730" end="02:43.020">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.400" end="02:50.340"><span begin="02:44.400" end="02:44.820">The </span><span begin="02:44.820" end="02:45.330">friend </span><span begin="02:45.330" end="02:45.540">I'm </span><span begin="02:45.540" end="02:46.770">dreaming </span><span begin="02:46.770" end="02:47.100">of </span><span begin="02:47.100" end="02:47.370">is </span><span begin="02:47.370" end="02:48.240">far </span><span begin="02:48.240" end="02:50.340">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.450" end="02:55.380"><span begin="02:51.450" end="02:51.750">And </span><span begin="02:51.750" end="02:53.040">doesn't </span><span begin="02:53.040" end="02:53.820">feel </span><span begin="02:53.820" end="02:54.210">my </span><span begin="02:54.210" end="02:55.380">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.860" end="03:06.330"><span begin="02:58.860" end="02:59.790">But </span><span begin="02:59.790" end="03:00.360">I </span><span begin="03:00.360" end="03:01.980">do</span><span begin="03:01.980" end="03:03.130">.</span><span begin="03:03.130" end="03:04.280">.</span><span begin="03:04.280" end="03:05.430">. </span><span begin="03:05.430" end="03:06.090">I </span><span begin="03:06.090" end="03:06.330">do</span></p></div></body></tt>